VALUES ('SMO10', 'SERMORELIN', '10mg', 'GH-RH Analog · Growth Hormone Secretagogue · ≥99% purity · For laboratory research use only', 'SERMORELIN (10mg) is a synthetic peptide analog of the naturally occurring growth hormone-releasing hormone (GHRH), used in research to study the regulation of growth hormone secretion and its effects on cellular processes. This peptide has been employed in various studies to investigate its potential role in modulating growth hormone release, cell proliferation, and differentiation in different cell types.', 79, 0, 5, 0, 'data:image/jpeg;base64,', 'purity', 'storage', 'form', 'cc', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
