VALUES ('2S10', 'SS-31', '10mg', 'Mitochondrial-targeted peptide · Cardiolipin-binding · ≥99% purity · For laboratory research use only', 'SS-31 (10mg) is a cell-permeable, mitochondria-targeting peptide known for its ability to reduce mitochondrial reactive oxygen species (ROS) and improve mitochondrial function, making it a valuable tool for studying cellular aging and longevity. This research peptide has been used in various studies to investigate its potential effects on aging-related diseases and age-related mitochondrial dysfunction.', 89, 0, 5, 0, 'https://pub-37b074dc65024137894d4252794502aa.r2.dev/Product%20Vials/76-ss-31-10mg.png', 'purity', 'storage', 'form', 'cc', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
